{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hungry Horrors Demo gives you an early taste of our culinary roguelite deckbuilder adventure! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is our first playable demo, and we're actively looking to enhance it based on your valuable feedback. We warmly invite you to join our Discord community to share your thoughts and suggestions. Every piece of feedback is greatly appreciated, helping us shape Hungry Horrors into the best possible game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530560/extras/fachan-hate.gif?t=1742954128\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT'S IN THE DEMO?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete tutorial to get you cooking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First two biomes packed with mythical monsters from British and Irish folklore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A handful of unique NPCs, rooms, and selected culinary cards from the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Numerous gameplay mechanics providing a flavour of what's to come.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530560/extras/choose-buff.gif?t=1742954128\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note, this demo represents a work-in-progress. As we continue development, everything is subject to change, and we're planning regular updates to add even more content directly into the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to wishlist Hungry Horrors and follow us here on Steam to stay updated whenever fresh content drops for the demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for joining us on this journey!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3530560?t=1742954128","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass