.gif?t=1742954128\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note, this demo represents a work-in-progress. As we continue development, everything is subject to change, and we're planning regular updates to add even more content directly into the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to wishlist Hungry Horrors and follow us here on Steam to stay updated whenever fresh content drops for the demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for joining us on this journey!</p>","developers":["Clumsy Bear Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3048840","name":"Hungry Horrors"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530560/c5496f0f6112603fc56a2ff6458c2022b0a1e904/header.jpg?t=1742954128","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Hungry Horrors\u00ae is a registered trademark of Clumsy Bear Studio Limited. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBD MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBD MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBD MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBD MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBD MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBD MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD</li